/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: bob gcal sync renders buffers and files MEETs on [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]buffered spans[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]gcal-sync-buffers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after buffer-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gcal-sync-buffers: render \\[buffer::] in the Google-owned badge run, keep[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that run intact on reroutes, use buffered spans for sync phases and MEET[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clusters, show buffers in list/sync output, and document them in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/gcal.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: MEET event runs and run-into-event warnings honor [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]buffers[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-buffers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after buffer-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-buffers: buffered MEET event runs and far-run text, conflict [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detection/overlap/fit/messages via the shared predicate, additive buffer[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON, meet_event_run and event_task_close vector cases, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/capture.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: capture-pomodoros --tasks events block carries [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]buffers[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]agenda-buffers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after buffer-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agenda-buffers: per-row and chip buffer objects, buffer-aware [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gap/conflict/start_hint/refresh_at, the human Events block label, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new agenda-events-buffered golden.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: hatched buffer wings and a buffer-aware JS mirror[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] me